1
00:00:46,806 --> 00:00:52,019
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,043 --> 00:00:53,060
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,085 --> 00:00:54,215
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:54,239 --> 00:00:55,779
=Episode 4=

5
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:02,439
Wait!

6
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:03,679
I haven't lost yet.

7
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,400
Are you blind?

8
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
That's imperial green jadeite.

9
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,519
You think your cheap bean-green jadeite
can beat that?

10
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:11,200
Dashan.

11
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,640
Let him finish.

12
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:14,920
Tujiu.

13
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,000
My bean-green jadeite is real.

14
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:24,840
But your imperial green jadeite

15
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,719
may not be the real thing.

16
00:01:32,079 --> 00:01:33,159
Everyone here knows

17
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:34,879
real jadeite

18
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,560
is hard.

19
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,640
You need a diamond saw blade to cut it.

20
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,799
But look at this piece.

21
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:43,120
The cut is clean and smooth.

22
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:45,640
Does that look natural to you?

23
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,560
If you think that's real imperial green,

24
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:52,000
you need your eyes checked.

25
00:01:55,159 --> 00:01:56,120
You lose. That's that.

26
00:01:56,519 --> 00:01:57,359
Stop making a scene.

27
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,280
Get him! Now!

28
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,280
So who really lost?

29
00:02:02,649 --> 00:02:04,856
- What are you doing?
- You scared me!

30
00:02:04,881 --> 00:02:06,696
It is fake!

31
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,660
It really is fake!

32
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,599
Mine may be ordinary bean-green jadeite,

33
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,560
but it's completely natural.

34
00:02:18,479 --> 00:02:19,680
Your so-called imperial green jadeite

35
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:21,599
was just filled with resin

36
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,360
and wrapped in a real stone shell.

37
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:26,080
No matter how perfect it looks,

38
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,280
it is fake.

39
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:28,639
It'll never be real.

40
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:29,879
You lose.

41
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,400
Resin-filled?

42
00:02:32,639 --> 00:02:33,439
Mr. Natuo,

43
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:36,360
you dared use resin-filled fake jadeite
at the jade appraisal event?

44
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,080
What nonsense are you spouting?

45
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:41,319
I'll take you down!

46
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:43,280
Mr. Natuo!

47
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:45,599
Cheating at the jade appraisal event

48
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,919
breaks the rules Mian laid down.

49
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,120
Mr. Natuo,

50
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:51,080
you actually broke Mian's rules?

51
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,639
You're such a sore loser, aren't you?

52
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:53,759
What a sore loser.

53
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,080
Shut up!

54
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,319
Mian's been gone for years.

55
00:02:58,879 --> 00:03:00,039
He's never even shown his face.

56
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,599
Only you people
still treat him like a big deal.

57
00:03:03,479 --> 00:03:04,280
You're scared of him, right?

58
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,560
Fine, then you can...

59
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:06,800
Shut up!

60
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,520
Haven't you embarrassed us enough?

61
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,240
Ren was Mian's most trusted aide.

62
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,120
Even your father respects him.

63
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:14,639
Do you have a death wish?

64
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:17,960
Ren.

65
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,039
We take full responsibility
for what happened today.

66
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:22,560
Everyone,

67
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,960
we'll refund every bet in full.

68
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,639
The Songcai family

69
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,639
will give everyone a proper explanation.

70
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,520
Now get out.

71
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:34,919
Get out.

72
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:41,280
Zhou Yan, right?

73
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:44,439
Looks like I was right about you.

74
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,560
You've got some real talent.

75
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,319
Why don't you work with me?

76
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,000
Once you have money,

77
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,840
you can find another girlfriend.

78
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,840
(Langia will eat you alive.)

79
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,680
(Come home with me.)

80
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:15,759
(So what?)

81
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,560
(You think I want to go back
to my old life?)

82
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,720
(I'm not going back with you.)

83
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:23,759
Hey.

84
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,439
Uh...

85
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:26,120
Are you guys off work?

86
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,839
Yeah. We're done for the day.

87
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:28,399
Why?

88
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:29,920
Uh...

89
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,639
Is Miss Daya off work yet?

90
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,879
She just left.

91
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:36,160
Just now?

92
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,040
Yeah.

93
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,720
Do you know where she lives?

94
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:41,560
I think she lives in Mambabo.

95
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,480
Mambabo?

96
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,199
Yeah.

97
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,319
Okay. Thanks.

98
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,079
No problem.

99
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:48,759
Mambabo...

100
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,680
What are you staring at?
Play your cards.

101
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,000
Pair of aces.

102
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:08,680
Pass.

103
00:05:09,759 --> 00:05:10,160
Pair of threes.

104
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:12,439
Pair of queens.

105
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:15,759
Pair of twos.

106
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:16,959
Pass.

107
00:05:16,959 --> 00:05:17,480
Pass.

108
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,680
Three eights.

109
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,040
Hey!

110
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,240
What are you doing here?

111
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,399
I'm with her. We're together.

112
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:27,480
No outsiders allowed.

113
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:29,720
Pair of threes.

114
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,680
Do me a favor. Let me in.

115
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,319
You don't look like a local from Langia.

116
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,040
I'm from Huaguo.

117
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,519
Oh.

118
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:41,279
You're from Huaguo?

119
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,319
You're from Huaguo? Fine, get in.

120
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,199
Thanks.

121
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:54,480
Hey, handsome. Have some fun?

122
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:55,959
Hey, handsome!

123
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,800
Why did you lie to me?

124
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:10,839
Whoa!

125
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:11,759
What are you doing here?

126
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,519
You got a death wish?

127
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:14,360
There was never any invitation.
Why did you lie to me?

128
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,879
Why else? For money.

129
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,360
You want it back?

130
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,680
It's gone.

131
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,720
I can't pay you back.

132
00:06:22,744 --> 00:06:24,264
You idiot!

133
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:27,560
That money was to save my girlfriend.

134
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,480
How could you scam me out of money
meant to save a life?

135
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,480
So what do you want?

136
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:32,680
Worst case,

137
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,240
I'll pay you back in bed.

138
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,600
How about that?

139
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,319
Come on.

140
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,079
What do you like?

141
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:38,480
Come on.

142
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:39,600
Go ahead.

143
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,079
Come on.

144
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:41,879
What's wrong with you?

145
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:47,839
Put your clothes back on.

146
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:58,600
Every guy wants to take my clothes off.

147
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,000
You're the first one

148
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:04,759
who ever covered me up.

149
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,920
Your back...

150
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:18,040
My mother sold me to Grand Royal

151
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,480
before I even came of age.

152
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:21,639
They told me

153
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,600
if I made ten million,

154
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,279
I could leave Grand Royal.

155
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,439
I made the ten million.

156
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:31,879
I paid them every last cent.

157
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,519
But when I gave them the money,

158
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:36,600
they took it,

159
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:39,439
dragged me back, and beat me.

160
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,120
Those monsters...

161
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,800
I was so naive.

162
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:53,439
I actually believed their lies.

163
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:57,680
I'm sorry.

164
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,240
Find something to put on.

165
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,199
About the invitation...

166
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,199
I was wrong.

167
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,120
I'm sorry.

168
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:29,639
Are you hungry?

169
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:31,319
I'll make you a bowl of rice noodles.

170
00:08:32,399 --> 00:08:32,799
No, thanks.

171
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,720
I'll get you some medicine.

172
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:21,600
This is bad.

173
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:28,519
Grand Royal girls are something else.

174
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:17,279
Daya!

175
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,159
Daya!

176
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,000
Zhou Yan!

177
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:23,240
Go! Hurry!

178
00:10:25,519 --> 00:10:27,080
This is Natuo's trap!

179
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,240
Get out of here!

180
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,320
This is all my fault.

181
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:30,840
I'll get you out of here.

182
00:10:31,639 --> 00:10:34,960
I don't want anyone to see me like this.

183
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,080
Just go!

184
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:40,120
Go!

185
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:46,320
Go!

186
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:48,519
Grab him! Hurry!

187
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:49,080
I'm sorry.

188
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:50,720
I'm sorry.

189
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:51,679
I'm sorry.

190
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,120
Go!

191
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:54,679
That way!

192
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:55,440
You, this way!

193
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,080
Hurry!

194
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,639
Your face is all over the news now.

195
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:20,840
Natuo, you monster.

196
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,639
Daya and Grand Royal's slain hostesses
all tested positive for drugs.

197
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,399
Natuo may be involved in the drug trade.

198
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:30,279
If that's true,

199
00:11:30,679 --> 00:11:31,879
then Lin Sihan...

200
00:11:32,799 --> 00:11:33,080
She...

201
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:45,840
Where are you going?

202
00:11:46,519 --> 00:11:47,559
- Where are you going?
- Calm down!

203
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,240
How am I supposed to calm down?

204
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:50,919
What if Sihan gets hooked on drugs?

205
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,360
Natuo is crazy.

206
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,200
I'm afraid Sihan's in danger.

207
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,320
After how she's treated you,

208
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,600
why are you still looking for her?

209
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,440
She doesn't have to come back with me.

210
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,600
But I have to get her home.

211
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:02,519
The police are looking for you.

212
00:12:02,679 --> 00:12:04,120
Going out there is suicide.

213
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:07,080
(Looks like I was right about you.)

214
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,159
(You've got some real talent.)

215
00:12:10,679 --> 00:12:12,159
(Why don't you work with me?)

216
00:12:13,279 --> 00:12:14,080
There's someone who knows.

217
00:12:15,519 --> 00:12:15,960
Layla.

218
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:17,919
Layla?

219
00:12:18,639 --> 00:12:19,559
Why would she see you?

220
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,559
She helped me
at the jade appraisal event.

221
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:22,919
She must think

222
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:24,679
she can use me somehow.

223
00:12:25,879 --> 00:12:26,399
So

224
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:28,120
she'll definitely see me.

225
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:31,120
Hey!

226
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,639
I've bought all the groceries,

227
00:12:32,639 --> 00:12:33,559
are you coming back for dinner?

228
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,360
What do you want?

229
00:12:42,919 --> 00:12:43,879
I'm here to see Ms. Layla.

230
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:44,879
Tell her I'm here.

231
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:45,639
Wait here.

232
00:12:46,399 --> 00:12:47,600
There's a man from Huaguo at the gate.

233
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,320
He wants to see Ms. Layla.

234
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:49,960
(Let him in.)

235
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,360
Okay. Go on in.

236
00:13:11,879 --> 00:13:13,279
You've got some nerve.

237
00:13:17,159 --> 00:13:18,759
I... I didn't kill that hostess.

238
00:13:19,559 --> 00:13:20,320
I know.

239
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,799
Then I won't beat around the bush.

240
00:13:23,519 --> 00:13:24,639
You helped me
at the jade appraisal event,

241
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,240
because you saw an opening
in my feud with Natuo.

242
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,080
Word on the street is

243
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,399
Songcai's days are numbered.

244
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,320
When he's gone, you'll be
fighting Natuo for the inheritance.

245
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,080
So you need someone to shake things up.

246
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:35,879
Right?

247
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,559
Then tell me.

248
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,320
How exactly can you help me?

249
00:13:43,399 --> 00:13:44,559
As long as you help me get Sihan out,

250
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,519
I'll do anything you ask.

251
00:13:54,559 --> 00:13:56,039
I hear my stepson

252
00:13:56,039 --> 00:13:57,320
has gotten into the drug trade.

253
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:58,960
I need you

254
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,000
to find proof of his drug trafficking.

255
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,080
And I...

256
00:14:03,559 --> 00:14:05,120
I will draw him away for a little while.

257
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:06,440
If necessary,

258
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,840
I'll call the police and get you out.

259
00:14:08,159 --> 00:14:08,639
Oh.

260
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:09,440
And the girl too.

261
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:14,039
Okay.

262
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,039
Deal.

263
00:14:33,919 --> 00:14:35,000
I'm the one who saved you.

264
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:37,759
You know

265
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:39,559
what a body packer is, right?

266
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:44,960
Give it to me.

267
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:45,879
Give it to me.

268
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:47,240
Give it to me.

269
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,159
A body packer

270
00:14:49,919 --> 00:14:51,399
swallows one of these,

271
00:14:52,159 --> 00:14:53,320
carries it in their stomach,

272
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,559
then smuggle it out.

273
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,120
Give it to me.

274
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,120
If the packet stays intact,

275
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,919
you live.

276
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:00,879
But if it

277
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:03,720
breaks open,

278
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,000
you die.

279
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:07,320
Your best friend...

280
00:15:08,159 --> 00:15:09,159
That's how she died.

281
00:15:10,159 --> 00:15:11,799
She was a body packer for Suowen.

282
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,360
It was me...

283
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,799
I was the one who saved you from Suowen.

284
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:17,840
And you?

285
00:15:18,159 --> 00:15:19,159
What did you do?

286
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:21,360
You had the nerve
to bring that piggy here!

287
00:15:21,559 --> 00:15:23,320
You humiliated me in front of everyone.

288
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,480
You want it, don't you?

289
00:15:25,759 --> 00:15:26,159
Fine.

290
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,120
Here.

291
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,240
You can have it.

292
00:15:28,879 --> 00:15:29,720
Take it all.

293
00:15:47,519 --> 00:15:47,919
Come on.

294
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,080
Look at this.

295
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,919
Your boyfriend!

296
00:15:52,639 --> 00:15:53,639
Zhou Yan!

297
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,519
He's pretty good!

298
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:57,919
He actually escaped my trap.

299
00:15:59,879 --> 00:16:00,919
But that's okay.

300
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:03,799
He made me suffer,

301
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:06,600
so I'll make him

302
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:08,919
suffer even more.

303
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,039
Mr. Natuo.

304
00:16:25,399 --> 00:16:27,000
Ms. Layla just called.

305
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:29,000
She said it's urgent
and wants you over right away.

306
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:31,480
Let's go.

307
00:17:00,919 --> 00:17:01,519
Sihan!

308
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,480
Sihan! Are you okay? Sihan!

309
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:08,920
Zhou Yan...

310
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,200
I want...

311
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,880
I want to go home.

312
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:13,440
Okay.

313
00:17:13,839 --> 00:17:14,519
I'll take you home.

314
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:18,640
Hey,

315
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:19,559
piggy.

316
00:17:21,039 --> 00:17:22,519
You're so clever.

317
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:39,425
♪Dust rises along the border♪

318
00:17:39,450 --> 00:17:40,770
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

319
00:17:40,770 --> 00:17:42,130
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

320
00:17:42,130 --> 00:17:43,530
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

321
00:17:43,530 --> 00:17:44,890
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

322
00:17:44,890 --> 00:17:46,210
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

323
00:17:46,210 --> 00:17:47,530
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

324
00:17:47,530 --> 00:17:49,210
♪My life is mine to bear♪

325
00:17:49,356 --> 00:17:51,716
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

326
00:17:51,740 --> 00:17:54,340
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

327
00:17:54,386 --> 00:17:56,660
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

328
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:58,075
♪My fate is mine to command♪

329
00:17:58,100 --> 00:17:59,236
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

330
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:00,515
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

331
00:18:00,540 --> 00:18:01,795
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

332
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:03,113
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

333
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:04,541
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

334
00:18:04,566 --> 00:18:05,981
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

335
00:18:06,006 --> 00:18:07,188
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

336
00:18:07,213 --> 00:18:08,428
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

337
00:18:08,453 --> 00:18:09,915
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

338
00:18:09,940 --> 00:18:11,315
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

339
00:18:11,340 --> 00:18:12,659
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

340
00:18:12,684 --> 00:18:13,915
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

341
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:18,279
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

342
00:18:19,140 --> 00:18:20,635
♪With blood and sweat♪

343
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:22,179
♪I forge my glory♪

344
00:18:22,204 --> 00:18:23,340
♪In this world of chaos♪

345
00:18:23,340 --> 00:18:24,420
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

346
00:18:24,460 --> 00:18:25,900
♪My legend♪

347
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:27,533
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

348
